        + "Nothing leaves the phone. It runs at start-up and when you ask, at most twice a day, and only while you have granted it.";
    static final String SCREEN_SAYS =
        "Reads the text on the screen you are looking at — only when you invoke Orb as the assistant, only in an app you allowed, "
        + "never a login screen and never a payments app unless you named one an exception. It shows you what it read first "
        + "and keeps it only if you tap Remember.";
    static final String GRANTS_SAYS =
        "Reads which apps hold accessibility, notification-listener and device-admin powers — the ones that could watch you. "
        + "It needs no permission and runs at every start; this is what lets Orb alert you when one changes. It is always on, "
        + "because it protects you.";

    static final String CONTACTS_SAYS =
        "Reads the names, phone numbers and email addresses in your contacts — only while the People screen is open, only on the phone. "
        + "Nothing is kept, nothing leaves the phone, and nothing is written to your contacts. It needs your grant here and Android's own permission.";

    static final String APPSEC_SAYS =
        "Reads, for the apps Orb can see on your phone \u2014 those with a launcher icon and those with powerful services such as accessibility, "
        + "notification access, a keyboard or device admin \u2014 their name, where they were installed from and which permissions they hold; and a few "
        + "settings of the phone itself (screen lock, USB debugging, security-update date). Only when you run the Safety check, only on the phone. "
        + "Only counts are kept; nothing leaves the phone.";

    static final String DOCUMENTS_SAYS =
